{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unbound Eternity is a turn-based deck-building combat game where you\u2019re not the hero BUT the ultimate villain, defending your lands against endless assaults!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/topgif.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your domain, forge powerful cards, and face unpredictable events to grow stronger. Your goal? Survive and defeat the hero chosen by the god of order. Break the cycle and claim your reign over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine runes, upgrades, and craft card to <strong>BEAT THE GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each adventure is a fresh story, so choose your starting character and embark on a brand-new journey. Every run features new enemies, buildings, and tons of unlockable content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/2_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use runes to play your cards and create devastating combos. Multiply your damage, poison your enemies, and more! Though easy to grasp, the combat system is packed with depth and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each rune represents an action during your turn, and as a monster, you naturally have several at your disposal! Crush your enemies\u2026 but stay alert, anyone might have a secret boot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/combat__616_x_347_px_.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/3_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover rare abilities and forge them into cards to gain the upper hand in battle! Will you specialize in offense, defense, or embrace versatility?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/shop.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/4_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget dull map navigation! Here, you <strong>build</strong> your own path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for upcoming battles by constructing unique and quirky buildings to collect their rewards: shop discounts, immortality (really?), permanent combat buffs, and more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/map.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, how will <strong>you</strong> seize the advantage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274090?t=1743199711","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/a1b71f0a616b99e877b4651a1ac5f52371444259/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743199711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/f53985976c6bb1fc9625238a289fbbd9392d8f7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743199711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/f53985976c6bb1fc9625238a289fbbd9392d8f7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743199711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unbound Eternity is a turn-based deck-building combat game where you\u2019re not the hero BUT the ultimate villain, defending your lands against endless assaults!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/topgif.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your domain, forge powerful cards, and face unpredictable events to grow stronger. Your goal? Survive and defeat the hero chosen by the god of order. Break the cycle and claim your reign over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine runes, upgrades, and craft card to <strong>BEAT THE GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each adventure is a fresh story, so choose your starting character and embark on a brand-new journey. Every run features new enemies, buildings, and tons of unlockable content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/2_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use runes to play your cards and create devastating combos. Multiply your damage, poison your enemies, and more! Though easy to grasp, the combat system is packed with depth and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each rune represents an action during your turn, and as a monster, you naturally have several at your disposal! Crush your enemies\u2026 but stay alert, anyone might have a secret boot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/combat__616_x_347_px_.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/3_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover rare abilities and forge them into cards to gain the upper hand in battle! Will you specialize in offense, defense, or embrace versatility?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/shop.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/4_EN.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget dull map navigation! Here, you <strong>build</strong> your own path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for upcoming battles by constructing unique and quirky buildings to collect their rewards: shop discounts, immortality (really?), permanent combat buffs, and more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/map.gif?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1743199711\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, how will <strong>you</strong> seize the advantage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Yunicorn Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/header.jpg?t=1743199711","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500, Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Unbound Eternity","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,6 Ghz Dual Core or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<